  "text": "←\nAll states\nStatewide sales tax\nNone\nWhat's taxed?\nGood to know\nCommon questions\nHere's how each kind of item is treated in this state. Tap a row to read the plain-English note.\nWhat you're buying\nSales tax?\nWhat that means\nBullion Bars\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nBullion Coins\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nBullion Rounds\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nLegal-Tender Coins\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nNumismatic Coins\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nJewelry\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nIndustrial Precious Metal\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nCollectibles (Non-Coin)\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nPaper Currency\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nAccessories\nNo sales tax\nNo sales tax in Montana. You won't see sales tax on this on your order.\nWhat's covered by the exemption\nMontana has no general sales tax — there is nothing to exempt or apply.\nWhat's NOT covered\nNo general state or local sales tax on bullion\nCommon questions about sales tax on gold and silver in Montana.\nIs there Montana sales tax on gold or silver bullion?\n+\nNo. Montana has no state sales tax, so bullion is not taxed statewide.\nAre coins and numismatic items taxed in Montana?\n+\nNo. With no state sales tax, coins (including numismatic items) are not taxed statewide.\nIs jewelry taxed in Montana?\n+\nNo. Montana does not impose a statewide sales tax on jewelry.\nDo Montana resort taxes apply to bullion shipments?\n+\nUsually not. Resort taxes are generally not relevant to bullion shipments, but specific local rules can vary by location.",
